# Tune and Pitch: a semitone every two detents however quick the turn (no acceleration),
# on the drums (Tune, Pitch) and the acid line (Tune); other knobs still speed up
wait 200
expect track 0
# the kick's Tune (ENV twice, KNOB 3): 8 quick detents, 4 semitones
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 4
turn K3 8 5
expect tpar14 4
# an odd detent waits for its pair; back down to 0
turn K3 -1 5
expect tpar14 4
turn K3 -7 5
expect tpar14 0
# its Pitch (EDIT, KNOB 2): 10 quick detents, 5
tap EDIT
expect view 2
expect tpar4 0
turn K2 10 5
expect tpar4 5
# a quick turn of another knob still speeds up: Level (KNOB 3)
turn K3 -10 5
expect tpar13 <60
# the acid line's Tune (ENV twice, KNOB 3)
tap OCT-
expect track 4
tap ENV
tap ENV
expect view 4
turn K3 12 5
expect apar14 6
